    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984180/extras/9eaa969cf6322a9efbff584138cb4ca1.avif?t=1738666753\" width=600 height=90 /></span><br><br><strong>NIPA</strong> is a <strong>DUNGEON CRAWLER</strong> puzzle game with an oriental setting in which <strong>YOU CAN'T SHOOT</strong>.<br><br>Move, run, dodge, slow down time or transform into a ghost.<strong>NIPA will test the reflexes of the most skilled players</strong>. The only way to beat each level is repetition and perfection. The White Tower is a place full of obstacles and dangers that will delight those looking for a challenge.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984180/extras/12e82988d53e8391b22c57508a0c4598.poster.avif?t=1738666753\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984180/extras/12e82988d53e8391b22c57508a0c4598.webm?t=1738666753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984180/extras/12e82988d53e8391b22c57508a0c4598.mp4?t=1738666753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>With a<strong> aesthetic inspired by Hindu culture</strong> and a dynamic <strong>soundtrack</strong> in which each piece accompanies the level, NIPA will transcend players to another astral plane, one in which self-improvement plays a key role.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984180/extras/fe166e08c81c5e7cf8fc6b18644fed1e.poster.avif?t=1738666753\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984180/extras/fe166e08c81c5e7cf8fc6b18644fed1e.webm?t=1738666753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984180/extras/fe166e08c81c5e7cf8fc6b18644fed1e.mp4?t=1738666753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong><br><br>\u25cf Explore the White Tower and use your skills to dodge <strong>hundreds of bullets and enemies</strong>.<br>\u25cf Prepare to <strong>reincarnate</strong> over and over again until you beat the level.<br>\u25cf Take on puzzles against the clock and<strong>challenge your reflexes</strong>.<br>\u25cf 7 unique levels inspired by <strong>the chakras of the body</strong>, symbolising physical, mental, emotional and spiritual aspects.<br>\u25cf A Hindu setting with <strong>a pacifist message</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984180/extras/d0fde4894e66cc91694ebb54f0f3a4c6.avif?t=1738666753\" width=600 height=90 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984180/extras/9eaa969cf6322a9efbff584138cb4ca1.avif?t=1738666753\" width=600 height=90 /></span><br><br><strong>NIPA</strong> is a <strong>DUNGEON CRAWLER</strong> puzzle game with an oriental setting in which <strong>YOU CAN'T SHOOT</strong>.<br><br>Move, run, dodge, slow down time or transform into a ghost.<strong>NIPA will test the reflexes of the most skilled players</strong>. The only way to beat each level is repetition and perfection. The White Tower is a place full of obstacles and dangers that will delight those looking for a challenge.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984180/extras/12e82988d53e8391b22c57508a0c4598.poster.avif?t=1738666753\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984180/extras/12e82988d53e8391b22c57508a0c4598.webm?t=1738666753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984180/extras/12e82988d53e8391b22c57508a0c4598.mp4?t=1738666753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>With a<strong> aesthetic inspired by Hindu culture</strong> and a dynamic <strong>soundtrack</strong> in which each piece accompanies the level, NIPA will transcend players to another astral plane, one in which self-improvement plays a key role.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984180/extras/fe166e08c81c5e7cf8fc6b18644fed1e.poster.avif?t=1738666753\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984180/extras/fe166e08c81c5e7cf8fc6b18644fed1e.webm?t=1738666753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984180/extras/fe166e08c81c5e7cf8fc6b18644fed1e.mp4?t=1738666753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong><br><br>\u25cf Explore the White Tower and use your skills to dodge <strong>hundreds of bullets and enemies</strong>.<br>\u25cf Prepare to <strong>reincarnate</strong> over and over again until you beat the level.<br>\u25cf Take on puzzles against the clock and<strong>challenge your reflexes</strong>.<br>\u25cf 7 unique levels inspired by <strong>the chakras of the body</strong>, symbolising physical, mental, emotional and spiritual aspects.<br>\u25cf A Hindu setting with <strong>a pacifist message</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984180/extras/d0fde4894e66cc91694ebb54f0f3a4c6.avif?t=1738666753\" width=600 height=90 /></span>",
